  "messages": [
    "Oversight online. The citadel's plasma battery covers the whole middle of the basin. Stay out of its reach until you are ready to go in together.",
    "The Iron Legion in the north-east will raid you. Their Commander is their weak point.",
    "The gantry is powering up. Two minutes until the Colossus walks.",
    "The Colossus is out. It's going for the southern bases.",
    "The Colossus is down!",
    "Citadel sortie heading south-west!",
    "Citadel sortie heading south-east!",
    "The turret ring is broken. Hit the core!",
    "Iron Legion Commander destroyed. Their base is going dark.",
    "Fusion core breached! The citadel is falling.",
